# design-sync
# `.ds-sync/` is the sync tool's own checkout, `ds-bundle/` its per-run output and
# `/dist/` the tsc-emitted type tree the converter reads: all three are recreated by
# the steps in .design-sync/NOTES.md, never committed. `.design-sync/` itself IS
# committed (config, fork, previews, notes) except for these per-run artifacts.
.ds-sync/
ds-bundle/
/dist/
.design-sync/.cache/
.design-sync/learnings/
.design-sync/node_modules
.design-sync/chunk-*.json
.design-sync/upload-list.txt
